  "sourceTitle": "Chicken Breast Marinade",
  "sourceText": "Chicken Breast Marinade\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 31, 2009 - 11:40pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 boned chicken breasts\nEgg\nBread crumbs\nOil\n1 can Campbells Golden Mushroom Soup\n1 can of wine\n1/2 can chicken broth\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Bake at 350 degrees for 1/2 hour. 2 Pound the breast and dip in egg, coat with bread crumbs, fry in oil. Marinate in baking dish overnight with soup and wine and chicken broth. Cover with foil and bake.",
